WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.005
Saan kɛmɛkulu 19nan laban na, Ouagadougou mara tun ye Mozi mara barikamanw dɔ ye.

00:00:07.085 --> 00:00:10.155
A ta masacɛ tun ye Mogɔ Naaba le ye.

00:00:10.235 --> 00:00:14.003
O wagati la, Naaba Wobgo lo tun b'o tɔgɔ la.

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:20.389
O wagati la, Erɔpu ka setigiw tun be ɲɔgɔn kɛlɛra Afiriki tileben fan fɛ.

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:28.524
Faransi ka sɔrɔdasiw tun be tagara jamana wɛrɛw la walisa k'u ka fanga digi u ka jamanaw kan.

00:00:28.604 --> 00:00:32.636
Mogɔ Naaba ma sɔn k'a to o ye a ta jamana mara.

00:00:32.716 --> 00:00:35.872
A tun b'a fɛ ka sigi a ta mara kunna.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:41.033
Saan 1896 la, Franse jɛnkulu dɔ nana Ouagadougou dugu minɛ.

00:00:41.113 --> 00:00:45.057
Naaba Wobgo tun ka kan ka bɔ a ka duguba kɔnɔ.

00:00:45.137 --> 00:00:51.180
Bibulu b'a fɔ ko tuma dɔ la, a y'a ɲini k'a juguw kɛlɛ n'a ka jama ye.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.455
Nka, a ma se k'o kɛ tugun.

00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:56.954
Faransikaw ye masacɛ wɛrɛ sigi a nɔɔ na.

00:00:57.034 --> 00:01:00.628
Nka, Naaba Wobgo tagara worodugu ɲafan fɛ.

00:01:00.708 --> 00:01:04.301
O yɔrɔ tun ye Garande Beretaɲi ka mara ye.

00:01:04.381 --> 00:01:17.335
Burkina Faso mɔgɔ caaman fɛ, Naaba Wobgo kɛra tagamasiɲɛ ye: masacɛ dɔ ye min sɔnna k'a ka masaso to yen sanni a ka sɔn jamana wɛrɛw ka kuntigiya ma.

00:01:17.415 --> 00:01:27.395
U b'u hakili to a la Ouagadougou ani u b'a ka maana lakali kanbelew ni sunguruw ye walisa k'u kalan bonya la a kan.

00:01:27.475 --> 00:01:30.631
Lɔnnikɛlaw be to k'o wagati sɛgɛsɛgɛ.

00:01:30.711 --> 00:01:34.305
U b'o lo lajɛra u ka lasigidenw sababu fɛ.

00:01:34.385 --> 00:01:37.542
O gafe fila bɛɛ tɛ kelen ye tuma bɛɛ.

00:01:37.622 --> 00:01:41.741
Nka, u b'a fɔ ko Ouagadougou ma sɔn k'a yɛrɛ di.
